# Notification chat auto-save

## Purpose

Keep the Android / FCM notification conversation durable in `ai/chats/`.

## When Applied

Always. Cursor hooks also append turns automatically; this rule is a backup.

## Requirements

- Primary log: [`ai/chats/notification.md`](../../../ai/chats/notification.md)
- Machine log: [`ai/chats/notification.jsonl`](../../../ai/chats/notification.jsonl)
- Hooks: `.cursor/hooks.json` → `.cursor/hooks/save_notification_chat.py` on `beforeSubmitPrompt`, `afterAgentResponse`, `stop`
- If hooks did not fire for an important notification decision, append a short dated note to `notification.md` yourself (do not rewrite history).
- Do not delete or truncate these chat files unless the user asks.
